# Subject + Object Combinations (Cross Product of E and F)
# Generated via script to handle chaining (e.g., Bazilya)
# TO-DO: Run the generation script and replace the line below with the output

# A special group of object markers in words like A"mwe"kutte Ba"gwe"wadde, Baa"ke"fumbidde
# These markers are reflexive
# In the .dic file, they should be implemented multiple times to cover all tenses and other cases
