PFX H 0 bee .
PFX H 0 gwe .
PFX H 0 gye .
PFX H 0 ze .
PFX H 0 kye .
PFX H 0 bye .
PFX H 0 lye .
PFX H 0 ge .
PFX H 0 ke .
PFX H 0 bwe .
PFX H 0 lwe .
PFX H 0 ze .
PFX H 0 kwe .
PFX H 0 ge .
PFX H 0 twe .

# Class I nouns 
PFX n Y 5
PFX n o   0   om
PFX n omu aba omu
PFX n omu ba  omu
PFX n omw aba omw
PFX n omw ba  omw

# Class II nouns 
PFX p Y 5
PFX p o   0   om.[wu]
PFX p omu emi omu
PFX p omu mi  omu
PFX p omw emy omw
PFX p omw my  omw

# Class III nouns 
PFX q Y 2
PFX q e  0 e
PFX q em 0 em # e.g emmayiro

# Class IV nouns 
PFX r Y 6
PFX r e   0   eki
PFX r e   0   eky
PFX r eki ebi eki
PFX r eki bi  eki
PFX r eky eby eky
PFX r eky by  eky

# Class V nouns 
PFX s Y 10
PFX s e 0     e.^r
PFX s e ama   e.^r  # eggi
PFX s e ma    e.^r
PFX s eri ama er # erinnyo
PFX s eri ma  e
PFX s ejj ama ejj # ejjuuni
PFX s ejj ma  ejj 
PFX s ery am  ery # eryenvu 
PFX s ery m   ery 
PFX s er  l   er # lyenvu 

# Class VI nouns 
PFX t Y 11
PFX t a   0    aka
PFX t aka obu  aka[^mn]
PFX t aka bu   aka[^mn]
PFX t aka obwa akamb
PFX t aka bwa  akamb
PFX t aka obwa akan[aeiou]
PFX t aka bwa  akan[aeiou]
PFX t aka obu  akam[^b]
PFX t aka bu   akam[^b]
PFX t aka obu  akan[^aeiou]
PFX t aka bu   akan[^aeiou]

# Class VII nouns 
PFX u Y 11
PFX u o    0    ol[wu]
PFX u olul enn  olul    # olulimi-->ennimi
PFX u olul n    olul
PFX u olu  en   olu.[^mn]
PFX u olu  n    olu.[^mn]
PFX u olu  em   olu[bp] # olubuto-->embuto
PFX u olu  m    olu[bp] # mpapula
PFX u olu  enzi oluggi  # Enziggi
PFX u olu  nzi  oluggi
PFX u olw  enny olwendo 
PFX u olw  nny  olwendo

# Class VIII nouns (large stuff)
PFX v Y 6
PFX v omu ogu omu # omuntu --> oguntu
PFX v omu gu  omu
PFX v omw ogw omw
PFX v omw gw  omw 
PFX v omu aga omu 
PFX v omu ga  omu

# Class IX nouns 
